=== 14.1 백지 그림 6개

```text
 (1) DRAM 1T1C          (2) leakage x5            (3) 3D NAND string
   WL                     1 subthreshold (ch)       [SSL]
    |                     2 GIDL (gate-drain)       [WL n] --+
  --+-- Tr                3 junction (SN-sub)       [ ... ]   | channel hole
  BL  |                   4 GOX tunneling           [WL 1] --+ (ONO + poly)
     [C] Cs = 10 fF       5 cap dielectric          [GSL]
      |                                             [CSL]
     plate

 (4) cap cylinder       (5) HBM stack             (6) causal chain
   D = 30 nm              [core die x 8-16] 50 um   process var
   |   |  H = 1 um        [bond layer] 20 um <- hot  -> structure
   |   |  AR 30-100       [core die]                 -> device param
   |   |                  [base die]                 -> product item
   +---+  ZAZ = 5 nm      [interposer] -- GPU        -> yield / reliability
```

